{"id":"457621","name":"四物汤","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"","cover":"images/457621/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"当归","amount":"6克"},{"name":"熟地","amount":"20克"},{"name":"白芍","amount":"12克"},{"name":"川芎","amount":"12克"}],"sub":[{"name":"红枣","amount":"8粒"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"四物汤料一包(去中药店购买，告訴你几人份量，分开每一剂一包，这样方便存放，一次一包)。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/20190509155737143461610602029.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"打开包装，四味中药材，稍微洗一下下。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/20190509155737149083610602029.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"取一汤锅放适量纯净水，把中药材放入锅中泡20分钟。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/20190509155737156338510602029.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"泡了20分钟后，加红枣。开处方中沒红枣的，我自己加八粒红枣，红枣也是补血的，汤口感也更甜。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/20190509155737172157710602029.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖上盖子，大火烧开转小火煲半小时就可以了。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/20190509155737178011810602029.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"半小时到了关火再焖10分钟就可以盛出饮用。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/20190509155737191255010602029.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"成品。盛出红枣和汤，其他汤渣不要。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/20190509155737213195910602029.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"凡是中药材洗净后泡一下才煮，药性更发挥得好。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}